# BullMQ

- Job payloads are IDs plus an idempotency key, not whole evidence blobs.
- One active scan per agent. PostgreSQL uniqueness is the product guarantee.
- Retries must be safe. Notifications use unique (signal, channel).
- Worker concurrency is `RIDDLR_WORKER_CONCURRENCY` (1–8). Job history is capped.
